<details id="image-text-editor" class="image-text-editor" hidden>
  <summary>Exact, editable text</summary>
  <p class="image-help">Add labels on a layer. The original stays kept. The JSON project contains the image and the text so you can resume your work.</p>
  <div class="text-editor-actions">
    <button id="image-text-prepare" type="button" class="quiet-button" disabled>Add text to this image</button>
    <button id="image-text-planned" type="button" class="quiet-button" hidden>Second pass: prepare the planned text</button>
    <label class="quiet-button text-editor-import" for="image-text-file">Reopen a JSON project<input id="image-text-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label>
  </div>
  <p id="image-text-status" class="image-help" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose an archived image or reopen a project.</p>
  <p id="image-text-error" class="text-editor-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
  <div id="image-text-workspace" hidden>
    <p id="image-text-source" class="image-help"></p>
    <p id="image-text-placement-hint" class="image-help" hidden></p>
    <div class="text-editor-preview"><canvas id="image-text-canvas" tabindex="0" aria-label="Text preview. Click to place the selected label or use the arrow keys."></canvas></div>
    <p class="image-help">Click the preview to place the selected label. The arrow keys move it by one pixel; Shift + arrow, by ten pixels.</p>
    <div class="text-editor-label-heading"><label for="image-text-label">Label to edit</label><button id="image-text-add" type="button" class="quiet-button">Add a label</button></div>
    <select id="image-text-label" aria-label="Label to edit"></select>
    <fieldset id="image-text-fields" disabled>
      <legend>Content and placement</legend>
      <label for="image-text-content">Exact text</label>
      <textarea id="image-text-content" rows="3" maxlength="600" aria-describedby="image-text-count" placeholder="Name, number or caption…"></textarea>
      <p id="image-text-count" class="image-help"></p>
      <div class="text-editor-grid">
        <label for="image-text-x">Horizontal position (%)<input id="image-text-x" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01"></label>
        <label for="image-text-y">Vertical position (%)<input id="image-text-y" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01"></label>
        <label for="image-text-size">Size (pixels)<input id="image-text-size" type="number" min="1" max="1024" step="1"></label>
        <label for="image-text-align">Alignment<select id="image-text-align"><option value="left">Left</option><option value="center">Center</option><option value="right">Right</option></select></label>
        <label for="image-text-color">Text color<input id="image-text-color" type="color" value="#ffffff"></label>
        <label for="image-text-background">Background color<input id="image-text-background" type="color" value="#162231"></label>
      </div>
      <label class="text-editor-checkbox" for="image-text-transparent"><input id="image-text-transparent" type="checkbox" checked>Transparent background</label>
      <button id="image-text-delete" type="button" class="quiet-button">Delete this label</button>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="text-editor-actions text-editor-exports">
      <button id="image-text-png" type="button" class="quiet-button">Download the PNG</button>
      <button id="image-text-svg" type="button" class="quiet-button">Download the SVG</button>
      <button id="image-text-json" type="button" class="quiet-button">Save the JSON project</button>
    </div>
    <p class="image-help">The PNG is flattened. The SVG contains the editable text. The JSON lets you reopen the project in this workshop. The exports contain the original image.</p>
  </div>
</details>
